sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant BFF as Next.js BFF
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant API as Spring Boot
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    User->>Browser: Sign in
    Browser->>KC: Authorization code flow with PKCE and state
    KC-->>BFF: Authorization callback
    BFF->>KC: Exchange and validate tokens
    BFF-->>Browser: Encrypted HttpOnly session cookie
    Browser->>BFF: Open a protected page
    BFF->>API: Bearer token + X-Organization-Id
    API->>API: Validate signature, issuer, audience and expiry
    API->>PG: Resolve active organization membership and role
    API->>PG: Apply ownership / direct-report rules
    API-->>BFF: Authorized DTO or safe error
    BFF-->>Browser: Rendered page with no bearer token in browser JS
